### Create a comment
@taskId = d80decf4-2758-4087-a8b6-4ecda9bf554a
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks/{{taskId}}/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "a7f372e2-6bd2-4a26-bac0-62ed64edd623",
  "body": "This task needs a design review before we start."
}

### Get all comments for a task
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks/d80decf4-2758-4087-a8b6-4ecda9bf554a/comments

### Update a comment
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks/comments/c1ebdd01-13ed-4e75-b254-867da49ba62f
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "body": "Updated — design review is now scheduled for Friday."
}

### Delete a comment
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks/comments/{commentId}